### Docker Create image task
POST {{dockerBaseUrl}}/api/image-tasks
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{dockerToken}}

{
  "prompt": "a realistic train running on railway tracks",
  "negativePrompt": "blurry, low quality",
  "width": 512,
  "height": 512,
  "steps": 20,
  "cfgScale": 7,
  "seed": 12345
}

  ### Docker Get image tasks
GET {{dockerBaseUrl}}/api/image-tasks
Authorization: Bearer {{dockerToken}}